                        We are available to take your call anytime, day or night.
                    </p>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div className="h-px bg-gray-200" />
                <div>
                  <h3 className="text-xs font-black text-[#FFB703] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mb-3">Contact Method</h3>
                  <div className="space-y-4">
                    <a href="tel:8187910743" className="flex items-center gap-4 group">
                      <div className="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-white border border-gray-200 flex items-center justify-center text-[#0F1E4A] group-hover:bg-[#0F1E4A] group-hover:text-white transition-all shadow-sm">
                        <svg className="w-5 h-5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M18.48 22.926c-4.481 0-8.956-1.708-12.383-5.135L5.135 16.829C1.708 13.403 0 8.928 0 4.447 0 2.21 1.761.447 4.025.447h1.611c1.233 0 2.308.796 2.658 1.968l1.45 4.832c.304 1.015-.1 2.115-1.002 2.716l-1.95 1.3c1.372 2.802 3.652 5.082 6.454 6.454l1.3-1.95c.601-.902 1.701-1.306 2.716-1.002l4.832 1.45c1.172.35 1.968 1.425 1.968 2.658v1.611c0 2.264-1.763 4.027-4.002 4.027z"/></svg>
